# A1/A1.2/A1_17_daily_work_routine.letz
# Source: PDF slide deck "L8 (Part 1) a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 8, Part 1)
# Source: PDF slide deck "L8 (Deel 2) a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 8, Part 2)
# Slash variants and bracket alternatives are split into atomic pairs;
# (m)/(f)/(n)/(pl) markers stripped; (formal)/(informal) qualifiers stripped.
# "regelméisseg" and "Bensin" corrected to LOD's "reegelméisseg"/"Bensinn".
# Distractor tokens are sourced from other entries within this same lesson where possible.
# Fills added: 18 — separable-verb prefix placement (8), prepositions/contracted
# forms (5), verb conjugation (3), adverbs of time (2). Mined from Deel 2:
# separable-verb grammar section, "Wéi gitt Dir schaffen?" dialogue,
# "Wou schafft ...?" profession-workplace exercise, working-hours expressions.

@lesson A1.17 "Daily Work Routine"

# --- Professions ---
