# --- @fill: separable verbs — prefix placement --------------------------------
# Separable verbs are the centrepiece of Deel 2's grammar: the prefix goes to the
# END of the clause. Each fill drills placing the correct prefix. Distractors are
# other separable prefixes from this lesson to force discrimination.

@fill
@lu Mäi Brudder steet all Dag um siwen Auer [op].
@en My brother [gets] up at seven o'clock every day.
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-lu fort
@distractor-lu heem
@distractor-en starts
@distractor-en leaves
@distractor-en comes

@fill
@lu Da fänke mir mat der Aarbecht [un].
@en Then we [start] work.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu fort
@distractor-lu heem
@distractor-en stop
@distractor-en leave
@distractor-en finish

@fill
@lu Si hält um véier Auer [op] mat schaffen.
@en She [stops] working at four o'clock.
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-lu fort
@distractor-lu heem
@distractor-en starts
@distractor-en leaves
@distractor-en arrives

@fill
@lu Duerno fuere mir vun doheem [fort].
@en Afterwards we [leave] from home.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-lu heem
@distractor-en stop
@distractor-en start
@distractor-en arrive

@fill
@lu Um fënnef Auer fueren ech [heem].
@en At five o'clock I [drive] home.
@distractor-lu fort
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-en leave
@distractor-en stop
@distractor-en start

@fill
@lu Mir komme géint siwe bei der Aarbecht [un].
@en We [arrive] at work around seven.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu fort
@distractor-lu heem
@distractor-en stop
@distractor-en leave
@distractor-en drive

# --- @fill: separable verbs — stem conjugation --------------------------------
# 3rd person singular of ufänken/ophalen changes the stem vowel. Distractors are
# the wrong person's form of the same verb.

@fill
@lu Hie [fänkt] um aacht Auer mat der Aarbecht un.
@en He [starts] work at eight o'clock.
@distractor-lu fänken
@distractor-lu fänke
@distractor-lu fänks
@distractor-en start
@distractor-en started
@distractor-en starting

@fill
@lu Du [häls] um véier Auer op mat schaffen.
@en You [stop] working at four o'clock.
@distractor-lu halen
@distractor-lu hält
@distractor-lu halt
@distractor-en stops
@distractor-en stopped
@distractor-en stopping

# --- @fill: prepositions and contracted forms ---------------------------------
# Transport-to-work uses contracted prepositions (mam, um) and directional `op`.
# Distractors are other prepositions from the same semantic field.

@fill
@lu Si fiert [mam] Zuch op d'Aarbecht.
@en She goes to work [by] train.
@distractor-lu mat
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu zum
@distractor-en with
@distractor-en at
@distractor-en to

@fill
@lu Ech fänke [um] aacht Auer u mat schaffen.
@en I start working [at] eight o'clock.
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu vum
@distractor-lu beim
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en from
@distractor-en near

@fill
